    "detailed_description": "<i>Tangram Collection</i> reimagines the classic tangram puzzle with a modern twist. Originating from China, tangrams challenge players to fit seven geometric pieces, or tans, into a specific shape without overlap.<br><br>In <i>Tangram Collection</i>, you'll be presented with five diverse bundles, totaling <strong>over 100 puzzles</strong>, which promise to get you through a minimalist and relaxing experience. The clean and intuitive interface sets you in a world where you solve complex problems, making it perfect for both tangram enthusiasts and casual puzzle lovers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 diverse bundles of tangrams<br></li><li>Over 100 puzzles to be solved<br></li><li>Minimalistic design for serenity</li></ul><br>Find the evolution of Tangrams with <i>Tangram Collection</i>.",
